Rāmah, Kṛṣṇah, Govindah, Gaurī, mitram - ityādīnāṁ sarveṣāṁ śabdānāṁ sambodhanarūpāṇi bhinnāni bhavanti.

(The vocative forms of all the words like Rāma, Kṛṣṇa, Govinda, Gaurī, mitra are different.)

