| ----- | सन्ध्या  | Sandhyā         | Name      | एषा        | Eṣā             | This is Sandhya |
| ----- | बालिका   | Bālikā          | Girl      | सा         | Sā              | That girl       |
| ----- | वृद्धा   | Vṛddhā          | Old woman | सा         | Sā              | That old woman  |
| ----- | नलिनी    | Nalinī          | Name      |            |                 |                 |
| ----- | सावित्री | Sāvitrī         | Name      |            |                 |                 |

